  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/514581321.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 211px;\" /><br /><br />Differentiating <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math> with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, equation of tangent is&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><br />Distance from centre =<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />Radius of circle <math><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c<